{
  "tema": 9494,
  "slug": "que-tan",
  "titulo": "¿Qué tan / cuán + adjective / adverb? = how...?",
  "subtitulo": "¿Qué tan lejos está?",
  "foto": "t09.jpg",
  "regla": "To ask about the degree of a quality: ¿qué tan + adjective / adverb? (how big, how far, how well): ¿Qué tan grande es? Very common in Mexico. Cuán is the same but formal. Works in direct and indirect questions; the adjective agrees.",
  "comparada_kwiziq": "2026-10-10",
  "secciones": [
    {
      "id": "regla",
      "titulo": "The rule",
      "bloques": [
        {
          "tipo": "formula",
          "partes": [
            "¿qué tan / cuán",
            "+ adjective / adverb",
            "+ verb?"
          ]
        },
        {
          "tipo": "texto",
          "texto": "It asks **how much** of a quality: _how big, how far, how long, how well_."
        },
        {
          "tipo": "texto",
          "texto": "**Qué tan** is the everyday choice in Mexico and much of Latin America. **Cuán** means the same but sounds formal or literary."
        },
        {
          "tipo": "texto",
          "texto": "Both have accents and never change; the **adjective** agrees: **¿qué tan pesadas son?**"
        },
        {
          "tipo": "texto",
          "texto": "Works in **indirect** questions too: **dime qué tan tostado lo quieres**."
        },
        {
          "tipo": "texto",
          "texto": "Tip: **qué tan** = _how_ + a quality."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "ejemplos",
      "titulo": "Examples",
      "bloques": [
        {
          "tipo": "ejemplos",
          "lista": [
            {
              "es": "—Alfredo, ¿==qué tan grande== es tu casa? —Grandísima, tiene ocho recámaras.",
              "en": "—Alfredo, how big is your house? —Huge, it has eight bedrooms."
            },
            {
              "es": "Siempre dices que tu esposo está muy gordo, pero ¿==qué tan gordo== está?",
              "en": "You always say your husband is really fat, but just how fat is he?"
            },
            {
              "es": "Dime ==qué tan tostado== quieres el pan.",
              "en": "Tell me how toasted you want the bread."
            },
            {
              "es": "Carlos, enséñale a Valentina ==qué tan bien== bailas cumbia.",
              "en": "Carlos, show Valentina how well you dance cumbia."
            },
            {
              "es": "—¿==Qué tan largo== es el documental? —Dura como dos horas.",
              "en": "—How long is the documentary? —About two hours."
            },
            {
              "es": "¿==Qué tan pesadas== son esas maletas?",
              "en": "How heavy are those suitcases?"
            },
            {
              "es": "¿==Qué tan lejos== está la playa?",
              "en": "How far is the beach?"
            },
            {
              "es": "No sabes ==cuán== feliz me haces.",
              "en": "You don't know how happy you make me. (formal)"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
